  unitName: Invictus Xeno Melchio
  unitId: 50276
  unitNumber: 1004
  description: A ten-winged figure that laid waste to Lizeria. His identity turned
    out to be one of the "Six Armors" that had been created by a scientist from another
    world. Having been destroyed by DUEL-GX, another of the Six Armors, its functions
    came to a complete stop. However, after the people of Grand Gaia were eradicated
    by the gods, Melchio came back to life as a monstrous being very unlike his original
    self. He continued to fight the gods until his half-broken armor was completely
    destroyed, though the reasons behind this course of action remain unknown.
  summonDesc: The world was already destroyed...<br>I...am...a vessel...<br>An...instrument...of
    the...gods...
  fusionDesc: I shall...destroy the Fallen Gods...<br>Thus I need more power...<br>It's
    a promise I made...long ago...
  evoDesc: I am already... If not...<br>I...represent the gods...<br>I must...restore...order...
  element: 5
  rarity: 6
